    <section xml:id="sec-section-7-4">
      <title>Section 50 - Integration in Spherical Coordinates</title>
      <objectives>
  <p><em>Learning Objectives</em></p>
  <ul>
    <li>
      Evaluate a triple integral in spherical coordinates.
    </li>
    <li>
      Convert a triple integral from rectangular to spherical coordinates and integrate.
    </li>
    <li>
      Change the order of integration in a spherical triple integral.
    </li>
  </ul>
</objectives>
